### 0. 下游正常
POST http://localhost:8081/chaos?mode=NORMAL

### 1. 正常调用，查看熔断器
GET http://localhost:8404/demo/burst?n=5

###
GET http://localhost:8404/ops/breakers

### 2. 强制熔断：下游明明是健康的，但所有调用都被拒绝
POST http://localhost:8404/ops/breakers/inventory/force-open

###
GET http://localhost:8404/demo/burst?n=5

### 3. 关闭熔断：下游全部报错，但熔断器不会打开
POST http://localhost:8404/ops/breakers/inventory/disable

###
POST http://localhost:8081/chaos?mode=ERROR

###
GET http://localhost:8404/demo/burst?n=10

### 4. 只统计不拦截：失败率会被统计出来，但不会打开
POST http://localhost:8404/ops/breakers/inventory/metrics-only

###
GET http://localhost:8404/demo/burst?n=10

###
GET http://localhost:8404/ops/breakers

### 5. 恢复正常的状态机
POST http://localhost:8404/ops/breakers/inventory/reset

### 6. 动态调参：把阈值放宽到 90%，下游 FLAKY 60% 时就不会熔断了
POST http://localhost:8404/ops/breakers/inventory/config?failureRateThreshold=90&waitSeconds=10

###
POST http://localhost:8081/chaos?mode=FLAKY&failRate=60

###
GET http://localhost:8404/demo/burst?n=20
